														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1904103">
									

<p>Oh man&#8230;</p>
<p>I had very different reactions to this and the main article.</p>
<p>I <em>really</em> like the beginning and the rationale (I originally upvoted based on its strength). I think the actual content is excessively silly and I really don't like the Foundation randomly being In On Teh Conspiracy &#8212; I'm guessing the implication is that O5-2 is A Lizard People or In On It Too at least? Yeah, bullshit. And more to the point <em>tiresome as all hell</em>. Maybe if you'd made it more entertaining, but it's&#8230; really just lizard people.</p>
<p>In other words, I really like &quot;the Foundation did lizard people&quot;, at least the way you framed it here. I really dislike &quot;yeah lizard people are totes straightforwardly real and they control gubmints and teh foundation lol&quot;.</p>
<p>Reluctantly downvoted.</p>

							</div>

								
					
